\": \"Complete7727-byte final document read. Exactly approved short budget clarification: local whole suite1800seconds/30min, static/focused180, independentCI10minute outerjob and genuine exact-published-commit success. No skipped test/timeout success/toolchain-equality/CIwaiver implied; all fixed-check/private-log/receipt/source publication instructions remain.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"self_host/services/github_agent/changelog/pr40-companion-discovery-4fc91268992e.md\",\n      \"sha256\": \"86f8f019c023d9444ac689291f2eef9d2fce8c1c872095639bf32d5a5d572afb\",\n      \"assessment\": \"Complete318-byte fragment is exact original179-byte source plus one139-byte local finite-budget note. Original inventory/scheduler repair wording retained. No version/release metadata change.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"cross_file_security_and_contracts\": {\n    \"no_validation_bypass\": \"Wholeprepush still unconditionally runs fixed static then full unittest discover, returns/records failure on timeout or nonzeroexit and cannot be narrowed through selected files. Longer finite deadline does not alter failure semantics or independently authorize a publication.\",\n    \"receipt_precision\": \"Python sys.version is recorded as before, but existing require_checks compares levelprepush and content fingerprint; it does not enforce interpreter equality. This implementation correctly leaves that schema/behavior unchanged and makes no false exact-toolchain enforcement claim. No private receipt was read/modified/generated by reviewer.\",\n    \"ci_unchanged\": {\n      \".github/workflows/repository-checks.yml\": \"aef054d06bd0dc6e5ac6115f90c6cf4abd46af11676385d597a7cec55598dd51\",\n      \".github/required-workflows.json\": \"8d14241a212f0e7c09e261913e05c5f401fda8e18364a8329f421bed6f6a176d\"\n    },\n    \"ci_contract\": \"Both actual files independently compared byte-for-byte with426. Ubuntu/Python3.13,10minuteouterjob, requiredRepositoryChecks and exactSHA push/dev CI admission remain. Current source cannot substitute old426 baseCI, anotherbranch result or latestbranch status.\",\n    \"publication_contract\": \"Existing self_hostAGENTS/MCP workflow commits explicit individual paths and pushes originDEV directly; no new self_host PR publication route is invented. Main remains explicit-promotion+VM boundary, runtime install/restart separate. No heldATKfeaturebranch mutation or privateDB/control ownership bypass.\",\n    \"scope_alignment\": \"This seven-file payload supports actual companion relevance discovery and necessary genuine local validation on supported slow host. It does not claim a native PR40 planner can operate self_host, complete native/glyph/SQLExplorer visual acceptance, or complete all qualifying PR merges.\"\n  },\n  \"validation_status_and_limits\": {\n    \"focused\": \"Parent reported managed focused3file run test_companion_discovery,test_worker_roles,test_workflow active in session37790 when request sent. No result supplied to reviewer at report time; neither pass nor failure is claimed.\",\n    \"full_prepush\": \"No genuine final seven-file fullprepush completion observed yet. Prior600second timeout originals, truncated ResourceWarnings/outcome and possible earlier failures remain unresolved. The new1800 allowance permits a real attempt, not a promise of green or absence of failures.\",\n    \"old_source_approval\": \"Original four-file source approval does not authorize the new workflow changes by itself. This fresh complete seven-file assessment evaluates them against approved amendedv3 and preserves prior review history.\",\n    \"plan_versus_source\": \"Approved amended plan established allowable implementation scope; this source assessment independently verifies actual source. Neither replaces required real local checks, signature/provenance/ownership action checks or exactpublishedSHA CI.\",\n    \"checks_not_run_by_reviewer\": \"No candidate program, import, unittest, service, integration, build, scene, container or Pi